hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1238","Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Al-Mubarak Al-Mukhurami narrated to us, Abu Dawud Al-Hafari narrated to us, H. Yusuf bin Musa narrated to us, Abu Dawud narrated to us Dawood Omar bin Saad, on the authority of Hafs bin Ghayath, on the authority of Humaid, on the authority of Abdullah bin Shaqiq, on the authority of Aisha, she said: I saw the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace “He prays cross-legged”"
